    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a fan-made Touhou Project work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through Gensokyo in this unique Fighting Game inspired by classic Touhou Project entries. <br><br><strong>Currently in development; features and visuals are subject to change.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and Seamless Online Play with Rollback Netcode.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more hassles like port-forwarding and installing mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight online with friends comfortably and easily, while enjoying the advantages of smooth rollback netcode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Refined Deck Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you want to play! Customize your supers, specials, and system cards with this beloved deck building system only seen in older Touhou fighting game entries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competitive Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be fun at all levels of play, with a big focus on letting you viably compete with any character with any deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All options are designed to be balanced, fun and unique, and are battle tested by genre veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun in Casual Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of having to sit in practice mode for hours before you can play online or boring autocombos that are not competitively viable but not fun to do either?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Dream Duel features a unique combo system that let you express yourself, while still enjoying yourself even if you don't like memorizing combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the whole Moveset with <strong><i>optional</i> one button specials</strong> that <strong>don't offer any competitive advantage</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/309fd80cf149abbfebd861edbf6fb6a9.poster.avif?t=1747770264\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/309fd80cf149abbfebd861edbf6fb6a9.webm?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/309fd80cf149abbfebd861edbf6fb6a9.mp4?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Movesets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Touhou Project Boasts some of the most unique characters in all of gaming. Utilize moves from official Touhou Project works as well as a ton of new unique moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/724b6b64d941f7a009d970962555d9e1.poster.avif?t=1747770264\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/724b6b64d941f7a009d970962555d9e1.webm?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/724b6b64d941f7a009d970962555d9e1.mp4?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Features Out of the Box</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your play to the next level with replay takeover and advanced practice mode settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weather Manipulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only seen before in the official Touhou Fighting games, this unique system let's you change the tide of battle by outsmarting your opponent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With less randomness and more ways to control the weather, harness the chaos to gain an edge over your opponent.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a fan-made Touhou Project work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through Gensokyo in this unique Fighting Game inspired by classic Touhou Project entries. <br><br><strong>Currently in development; features and visuals are subject to change.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and Seamless Online Play with Rollback Netcode.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more hassles like port-forwarding and installing mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight online with friends comfortably and easily, while enjoying the advantages of smooth rollback netcode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Refined Deck Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you want to play! Customize your supers, specials, and system cards with this beloved deck building system only seen in older Touhou fighting game entries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competitive Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be fun at all levels of play, with a big focus on letting you viably compete with any character with any deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All options are designed to be balanced, fun and unique, and are battle tested by genre veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun in Casual Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of having to sit in practice mode for hours before you can play online or boring autocombos that are not competitively viable but not fun to do either?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Dream Duel features a unique combo system that let you express yourself, while still enjoying yourself even if you don't like memorizing combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the whole Moveset with <strong><i>optional</i> one button specials</strong> that <strong>don't offer any competitive advantage</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/309fd80cf149abbfebd861edbf6fb6a9.poster.avif?t=1747770264\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/309fd80cf149abbfebd861edbf6fb6a9.webm?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/309fd80cf149abbfebd861edbf6fb6a9.mp4?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Movesets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Touhou Project Boasts some of the most unique characters in all of gaming. Utilize moves from official Touhou Project works as well as a ton of new unique moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/724b6b64d941f7a009d970962555d9e1.poster.avif?t=1747770264\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/724b6b64d941f7a009d970962555d9e1.webm?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680470/extras/724b6b64d941f7a009d970962555d9e1.mp4?t=1747770264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Features Out of the Box</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your play to the next level with replay takeover and advanced practice mode settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weather Manipulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only seen before in the official Touhou Fighting games, this unique system let's you change the tide of battle by outsmarting your opponent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With less randomness and more ways to control the weather, harness the chaos to gain an edge over your opponent.</p>",
